theme = ExtResource("1_hsgj5")
script = ExtResource("2_hsgj5")
Tutorial = Array[String](["", "Welcome at Tiny Globes!", "The place where you create Tiny Worlds for many different People.", "", "Use LEFT click to pick up items,", " merge them with others and", "use RIGHT click to disassemble them.", "You can open the drawer by clicking on it ", "and to the right you find some Buttons with", "wich you can change the current Floor of the drawer.", "To close the drawer click the x button next to the other buttons.", "", "Your goal is simple, to create globes", "that fit the preferences of your customers.", "", "A snowglobe is made out of a base,", "a globe (wich can be found in the drawer) and the inside. ", "You can get the insides for the globe", "by pulling the lever at the gacha-machine.", "Put the parts together in this order and when you made", "enough globes you can start giving them out to your customers.", "", "The game is structured in 5 days with them having 2 stages:", "First - building the snow globes", "Second - handing globes out to customers", "You first talk to them to know wich globe belongs", "to who, and then give them the globe!", "", "In your tablet you can find the email app,", "with wich customers will contact you and the control app,", "where you can see your stores current rating and", "open the shop after assembling enough globes.", "", "Have fun building", "TINY WORLS! :D"])

